<title>SWITZERLAND: Elektrowatt posts lower 1995/96 profit.</title>
<headline>Elektrowatt posts lower 1995/96 profit.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elektrowatt AG said its net profit in the business year 1995/96 was 97 million Swiss francs versus a profit of 210 million a year earlier.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that the net profit was lower than the year before due to one-time provisions and value adjustments, but was above expectations for the year.</p>
